<title>USA: BRE Properties acquires apartment group.</title>
<headline>BRE Properties acquires apartment group.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BRE Properties Inc, a real estate investment trust, on Tuesday said it has acquired a 350-unit apartment community in Las Vegas, called Talavera at Peccole Ranch, for a cash price of $26.2 million.</p>
<p>BRE's portfolio of wholly-owned apartment homes now totals 12,562 units at 54 apartment communities in nine major markets in the Western United States.</p>
</text>
